Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,Main,0,0,0,,---- Main ----
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.71,0:01:03.49,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,是遊樂場…
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.71,0:01:03.49,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,An arcade....
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.13,0:03:03.82,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,蓮司君 這邊也麻煩你了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.82,0:03:05.28,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.46,0:03:35.19,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,搞什麼鬼啊
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.46,0:03:35.19,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.19,0:03:35.94,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.02,0:03:41.41,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,哦 還要繼續玩啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.84,0:03:46.60,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,呵呵 抱歉啦 小姐 經濟就是這樣運轉的…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.60,0:03:48.28,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,喂 蓮司君！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.66,0:03:51.71,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不好意思！ 我馬上過去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.97,0:04:08.10,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.10,0:04:09.37,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.37,0:04:10.79,Text,Part-timer B,0,0,0,,明天見
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.61,0:04:19.53,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦？ 還在玩啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.53,0:04:21.23,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,從那之後過很久了耶？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.89,0:04:28.49,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,還有那隻無情又不動如山的無尾熊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.74,0:04:52.27,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.74,0:04:52.27,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.45,0:05:17.54,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 1,0:05:16.45,0:05:17.54,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.31,0:05:24.35,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,給妳
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.67,0:05:38.23,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我… 我是不是多管閒事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.68,0:05:43.95,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,呃… 這是日本的吉祥物！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.95,0:05:45.87,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,給妳的禮物…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.87,0:05:48.71,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,該怎麼說呢… 啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.05,0:05:52.39,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,情… 情人節快樂！
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.05,0:05:52.39,Text-English,Renji,0,0,0,,H-Happy Valentine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.98,0:05:56.21,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,情人節…？
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.98,0:05:56.21,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Valentine's day...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.59,0:06:00.97,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊… 對 對 是情人節
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.59,0:06:00.97,Text-English,Renji,0,0,0,,Uh... Yes, yes! Valentine's Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.97,0:06:03.08,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,給妳的禮物！
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.97,0:06:03.08,Text-English,Renji,0,0,0,,A present for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.40,0:06:10.85,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,這個是要給我的嗎？
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.40,0:06:10.85,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Are you giving this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.11,0:06:12.59,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.11,0:06:12.59,Text-English,Renji,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.36,0:06:25.48,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,好的 謝謝你 我會好好珍惜的
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.36,0:06:25.48,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,All right. Thank you. Cherish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.79,0:06:28.06,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,哦 是的 是的
Dialogue: 1,0:06:25.79,0:06:28.06,Text-English,Renji,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.06,0:06:29.98,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,她剛才是說謝謝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.79,0:06:35.35,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,太好了 她好像真的很想要那個娃娃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.35,0:06:37.18,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,那… 再… 再見…
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.35,0:06:37.18,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,S-see you....
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.18,0:06:44.38,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不過我隨口說了情人節什麼的…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.13,0:06:50.38,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,嘛 算了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.17,0:07:14.39,Flashback,Renji,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,916)\t(2304,3220,\c&HFFFFFF&)\t(2304,3220,\3c&HFFFFFF&)}給妳的禮物
Dialogue: 1,0:07:11.17,0:07:14.39,Flashback-English,Renji,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,916)\t(2304,3220,\c&HFFFFFF&)\t(2304,3220,\3c&HFFFFFF&)}Present, For you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.01,0:07:27.68,High,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,要不要一起喝杯茶啊 我剛泡好喔
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.01,0:07:27.68,High-English,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,Hey, fancy a cuppa with me? I've just made some tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.53,0:07:29.01,Top,Lily,0,0,0,,媽… 媽媽！ 要敲門啦！
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.53,0:07:29.01,Top-English,Lily,0,0,0,,M-Mom...! Knock!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.80,0:07:31.06,High,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,咦 我有好好敲門了啊
Dialogue: 1,0:07:28.80,0:07:31.06,High-English,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,Oh? I knocked properly, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.22,0:07:36.06,High,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,妳真的很喜歡那個娃娃呢
Dialogue: 1,0:07:33.22,0:07:36.06,High-English,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,You seem to quite like that stuffed toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.52,0:07:41.23,High,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,499)\t(2041,3040,\c&H000000&)\t(2041,3040,\3c&H000000&)}難道是青春期到了嗎？
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.52,0:07:41.23,High-English,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,499)\t(2041,3040,\c&H000000&)\t(2041,3040,\3c&H000000&)}Something to do with puberty, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.21,0:07:52.23,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,那個啊… 蓮司君
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.81,0:07:53.97,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.72,0:08:02.88,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,你… 是不是對人家做了什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.88,0:08:06.94,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,沒有啦 我什麼都沒做… 真的…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.32,0:08:16.33,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,果然被當成可疑的傢伙了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.08,0:08:26.91,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,妳… 妳好
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.08,0:08:26.91,Text-English,Renji,0,0,0,,H-Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.91,0:08:33.51,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,你好！
Dialogue: 1,0:08:31.91,0:08:33.51,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,H-Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.51,0:08:35.12,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,呃 妳好
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.51,0:08:35.12,Text-English,Renji,0,0,0,,Uh, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.31,0:08:53.68,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那… 那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.23,0:08:56.64,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,如果可以的話 我差不多要下班了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.64,0:08:58.52,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,要不要帶妳逛逛這裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.02,0:09:00.01,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 1,0:08:59.02,0:09:00.01,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.37,0:09:05.02,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,呃 我會引導妳… 這間遊樂場
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.37,0:09:05.02,Text-English,Renji,0,0,0,,Ah. I will guide you... this game center.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.57,0:09:10.38,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,遊… 樂… 場…？
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.57,0:09:10.38,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Game... center?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.38,0:09:12.28,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,是的！ ゲーセン！
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.38,0:09:12.28,Text-English,Renji,0,0,0,,Yes! Gesen!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.38,0:09:16.31,Comment,Renji,0,0,0,,※ Gesen（{\fnNoto Sans CJK JP}ゲーセン{\r}）：Game Center（{\fnNoto Sans CJK JP}ゲームセンター{\r}）的縮寫
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.69,0:09:16.31,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我帶妳逛… 這間遊樂場！
Dialogue: 1,0:09:12.69,0:09:16.31,Text-English,Renji,0,0,0,,I'm guide you, this gesen!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.20,0:09:19.80,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,遊樂場…
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.20,0:09:19.80,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Gesen....
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.47,0:09:22.66,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,你要帶我逛逛嗎？
Dialogue: 1,0:09:20.47,0:09:22.66,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Will you show me around?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.96,0:09:25.48,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,「show」？「around」？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.48,0:09:27.17,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我來護送妳！
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.48,0:09:27.17,Text-English,Renji,0,0,0,,I will escort you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.17,0:09:28.36,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,什…？
Dialogue: 1,0:09:27.17,0:09:28.36,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Ha...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.89,0:09:32.17,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,你要護送我是嗎？
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.89,0:09:32.17,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Are you going to escort me, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.88,0:09:35.02,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,哦 是的 是的！
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.88,0:09:35.02,Text-English,Renji,0,0,0,,Oh, yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.19,0:09:50.83,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,怎麼樣？ 超棒的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.36,0:09:49.90,Top,Lily,0,0,0,,呃…
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.36,0:09:49.90,Top-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.83,0:09:52.79,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,「SAIKO」？ 什麼意思？
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.83,0:09:52.79,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,"SAIKO?" What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.16,0:10:03.07,Top,Game voice,0,0,0,,TURN AROUND! TURN AROUND!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.25,0:10:07.59,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,哇啊啊啊啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.52,0:10:06.53,Top,Game voice,0,0,0,,逆向了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.53,0:10:46.53,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,看來她還是沒有對我敞開心房呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.36,0:10:54.13,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,挑… 任何妳喜歡的吧
Dialogue: 1,0:10:51.36,0:10:54.13,Text-English,Renji,0,0,0,,Choose... anything you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.13,0:10:58.78,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,謝謝你…
Dialogue: 1,0:10:54.13,0:10:58.78,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Cheers... I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.17,0:11:03.12,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,接下來… 妳… 想玩什麼？
Dialogue: 1,0:11:00.17,0:11:03.12,Text-English,Renji,0,0,0,,What... do you want to do...  next?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.50,0:11:22.78,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦 妳想玩那個嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.30,0:11:31.59,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,哇 好久沒玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.59,0:11:32.98,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,為什麼？
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.59,0:11:32.98,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.98,0:11:37.32,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我還以為妳喜歡可愛的東西 沒想到妳對這種的也有興趣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.72,0:11:40.62,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我也很喜歡這個喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.62,0:11:42.61,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,喔 不…
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.62,0:11:42.61,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Oh no...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.61,0:11:44.15,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,別客氣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.15,0:11:46.28,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,好 要開始了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.89,0:11:57.64,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,別擔心 我來保護妳！
Dialogue: 1,0:11:54.89,0:11:57.64,Text-English,Renji,0,0,0,,Don't worry! I'll protect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.01,0:12:00.47,Top,Renji,0,0,0,,開玩笑的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.47,0:12:02.55,Top,Game 1P,0,0,0,,別擔心 我來保護妳！
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.47,0:12:02.55,Top-English,Game 1P,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'll protect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.55,0:12:05.30,Top,Renji,0,0,0,,這是這款遊戲的招牌台詞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.74,0:12:08.15,Top,Game 2P,0,0,0,,沒問題 我會自己想辦法的
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.74,0:12:08.15,Top-English,Game 2P,0,0,0,,No problem. Everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.30,0:12:13.16,Top,Game voice,0,0,0,,RELOAD!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.97,0:12:18.43,Top,Game voice,0,0,0,,MACHINE GUN!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.47,0:12:30.43,Top,Game voice,0,0,0,,JACKPOT!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.56,0:12:32.93,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,哇… 好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.32,0:12:38.70,Top,Game voice,0,0,0,,JACKPOT!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.70,0:12:39.80,Text,Observer R,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.09,0:12:40.45,Top,Game voice,0,0,0,,JACKPOT!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.80,0:12:41.27,Text,Observer L,0,0,0,,她瞄得好準
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.83,0:12:42.06,Top,Game voice,0,0,0,,JACKPOT!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.15,0:12:53.78,Text,Game 2P,0,0,0,,JACKPOT.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.76,0:13:03.98,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,哇 妳真的很厲害耶…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.98,0:13:05.76,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,好 下一個是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.09,0:13:32.76,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,果然最後還是會來這裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.88,0:13:40.37,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,喔 不…
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.88,0:13:40.37,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Oh no...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.75,0:13:44.19,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,還是不行啊… 我得幫她一把才行…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.19,0:13:45.18,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.18,0:13:46.93,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,需要我幫忙嗎？
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.18,0:13:46.93,Text-English,Renji,0,0,0,,Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.79,0:13:50.13,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那… 那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.41,0:14:04.16,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.59,0:14:09.06,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,可惜…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.75,0:14:17.69,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.93,0:14:58.70,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那個… 這個給妳
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.61,0:15:07.63,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,呃…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.88,0:15:10.92,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那麼 再見了…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.04,0:15:14.84,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.94,0:15:25.22,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,這是…
Dialogue: 1,0:15:23.94,0:15:25.22,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.76,0:15:29.11,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,回報你之前禮物的回禮
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.76,0:15:29.11,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,In return for the present you gave me before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.73,0:15:31.91,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦？ 這是給我的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.91,0:15:33.24,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,是我？
Dialogue: 1,0:15:31.91,0:15:33.24,Text-English,Renji,0,0,0,,It's me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.24,0:15:34.58,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,是的 沒錯！
Dialogue: 1,0:15:33.24,0:15:34.58,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Yes, it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.69,0:15:39.09,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,還有…
Dialogue: 1,0:15:37.69,0:15:39.09,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.09,0:15:42.08,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,謝謝你今天帶我到處逛逛
Dialogue: 1,0:15:39.09,0:15:42.08,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,thank you for showing me around today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.21,0:15:49.69,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,難道她拿到這個是為了送我嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.61,0:15:54.16,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,當我的… 情人？
Dialogue: 1,0:15:51.61,0:15:54.16,Text-English,Renji,0,0,0,,Be my... Valentine?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.21,0:15:59.16,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,這是什麼？ 大概是像「情人節快樂」那樣的問候吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.16,0:16:03.37,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,嘛 總之幸好她似乎沒有討厭我…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.37,0:16:04.10,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.62,0:16:09.29,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,她的名字… 我還沒問…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.95,0:16:27.45,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,真的假的！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.17,0:16:29.55,Text,Narrator,0,0,0,,是的 沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.55,0:16:33.54,Text,Narrator,0,0,0,,英國的情人節和日本相反
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.54,0:16:38.56,Text,Narrator,0,0,0,,是由男性向女性贈送禮物進行愛的告白的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.79,0:16:41.59,Flashback,Renji,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,173)\3c&HFFFFFF&\t(0,83,\c&HFFFFFF&)\t(0,83,\3c&H400000&)\t(1627,1800,\3c&HFFFFFF&)}給妳的禮物！
Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.79,0:16:41.59,Flashback-English,Renji,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,173)\3c&HFFFFFF&\t(0,83,\c&HFFFFFF&)\t(0,83,\3c&H400000&)\t(1627,1800,\3c&HFFFFFF&)}A present for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.05,0:16:44.24,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那也就是說 那時候也…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.00,0:16:49.44,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,好的 謝謝你 我會好好珍惜的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.23,0:16:54.35,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,這… 這麼說來 那也算是愛的告白了嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.35,0:16:55.81,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,真的假的！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.81,0:16:57.49,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,哥哥 好吵！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.04,0:17:00.23,Top,Renji,0,0,0,,葵衣！ 進來前… 要敲門…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.41,0:17:02.84,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,你也不看看現在幾點了 會吵到鄰居的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.84,0:17:05.23,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,對… 對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.16,0:17:16.84,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,妳… 妳好
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.16,0:17:16.84,Text-English,Renji,0,0,0,,H-Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.83,0:17:20.95,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那個 我有話想跟妳說…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.43,0:17:28.34,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.03,0:17:32.63,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊… 為什麼？ 等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.75,0:17:45.97,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊… 為什麼要逃跑啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.18,0:17:51.72,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,客人 等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.48,0:17:56.69,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,那傢伙今天有排班嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.69,0:17:57.56,Text,Part-timer B,0,0,0,,沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.82,0:18:15.06,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊 等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.45,0:19:10.78,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊啊 對不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.98,0:19:16.29,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我只是想把這個交給妳
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.40,0:19:31.40,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,妳好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.86,0:19:34.05,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,謝謝妳一直以來都光顧遊樂場
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.47,0:19:37.50,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我的名字是草壁蓮司
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.88,0:19:39.07,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,蓮司…
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.88,0:19:39.07,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Renji...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.82,0:19:44.16,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我的英文不太好 如果句子怪怪的還請見諒
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.23,0:19:47.68,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,謝謝妳昨天送的禮物
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.68,0:19:50.20,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我已經把它當作我的最愛來使用了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.23,0:19:53.96,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,還有 妳一起給我的那則訊息
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.96,0:19:58.56,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,意思真的是「請當我的情人」嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.06,0:20:02.47,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,如果是的話 我會非常高興
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.74,0:20:05.60,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.85,0:20:13.72,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我們不能成為情人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.21,0:20:20.99,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,因為我還不了解妳
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.99,0:20:22.96,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我甚至連妳的名字都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.63,0:20:28.12,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,所以我準備了這本筆記本
Dialogue: 1,0:20:28.12,0:20:31.84,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,希望能藉此讓我們互相了解
Dialogue: 1,0:20:31.84,0:20:37.14,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我想說如果能透過這個 和妳變得更要好就好了…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.14,0:20:39.56,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,也… 也能順便學習語言！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.13,0:20:41.22,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,妳覺得怎麼樣呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.47,0:20:48.31,High,Lily,0,0,0,,知道了 現在就先這樣吧
Dialogue: 1,0:20:44.47,0:20:48.31,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Gotcha. That's fine for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.36,0:20:56.40,High,Lily,0,0,0,,我一定會讓你愛上我的！
Dialogue: 1,0:20:54.36,0:20:56.40,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,I'll make you fall in love with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.30,0:21:01.08,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.73,0:21:06.24,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,嗚！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.24,0:21:07.40,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.88,0:21:15.42,High,Lily,0,0,0,,我的名字是莉莉 莉莉·貝卡
Dialogue: 1,0:21:12.88,0:21:15.42,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,My name is Lily! Lily Baker!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.76,0:21:18.66,High,Lily,0,0,0,,再見了 蓮司 下次見！
Dialogue: 1,0:21:15.76,0:21:18.66,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Good bye, Renji! See you next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.74,0:21:20.94,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,莉莉…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.52,0:21:24.29,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,原來那是她的名字…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.45,0:21:26.43,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊…！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.43,0:21:28.93,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那… 那下次見
Dialogue: 1,0:21:26.43,0:21:28.93,Text-English,Renji,0,0,0,,S-See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.93,0:21:30.94,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,要再來遊樂場… come on！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.57,0:21:37.86,High,Lily,0,0,0,,下次見！
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.57,0:21:37.86,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,See you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.54,0:21:41.29,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.29,0:21:42.94,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,下… 下次見！
Dialogue: 1,0:21:41.29,0:21:42.94,Text-English,Renji,0,0,0,,S-See you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.03,0:21:45.62,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,下次見！
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.03,0:21:45.62,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.24,0:21:53.85,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,就這樣 我和莉莉在遊樂場的異文化交流開始了
Comment: 0,0:01:18.02,0:01:18.02,Default,OP,0,0,0,,-- OP --
